<section class="about">
  <div class="about__image" role="img" aria-label="Foon promo image"></div>

  <div class="about__text">
    <p>The musicians of the electro-acoustic duo Foon (fo:n) share a love of electronic music, and both have roots in the jazz and improvisation scene. As in jazz, the composed pieces performed on stage serve as a framework for new improvisations. After their intimate, hyper-focused performances, audiences are left in awe with, as one listener described it, "a melting brain and firing neurons."</p>

    <p>Foon was born in 2024 in Amsterdam and has since performed mainly in forward-thinking clubs such as Garage Noord and OT301, as well as on stages for alternative music and jazz such as Cinetol, de Roode Bioscoop, and Burgzicht. In 2026, the duo will release Everything Is, their debut EP.</p>
  </div>
</section>
